arrier.domain: context-map\ncarrier.test: e2e-testing\nreview.ddd: review-ddd\nreview.hexagonal: review-hexagonal\nreview.clean-code: review-clean-code\nreviews: dca\nreview.dca: dca-audit\n\n# Where the project keeps its map; glossaries are the per-context glossary.md files.\ncontextMap: docs/architecture/context-map.md\n# What must hold for any change (story-gate.py --change, the commit hook, CI). The end-user suite\n# needs a running shop, so it stays out of it.\n# `--rerun` on the two required suites: an up-to-date Gradle task writes no new report, and the\n# change check only counts a test that a report from this run shows as executed.\nrequired: compile test test.integration architecture format\nacceptance: pages\nrun: ./gradlew bootRun\ncarrier.plan: dca-modelling\n","numLines":47,"startLine":1,"totalLines":47}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01U1p8ikw5eAZ9LpeAkKHVkg","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
